  "description": "To treat his sensitivity issues, Do-Won agrees to be part of the blindfolded kissing booth at the school festival. He thought he’d only get a few meaningless pecks, but ends up making out with a mysterious guy whose kiss is so intense, it makes him hard! Do-Won becomes obsessed with finding the other man, but he never imagined it’d be Jun-Hyeon, the otaku nerd from school who's a total jerk! Will Do-Won be able to accept that his body reacts to this nerd, or will Jun-Hyeon's secretly sexy side be his undoing?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
